# Native shell build outputs — irrelevant to the server image and large
# enough (Gradle/.gradle, Cargo target/) to slow down every build-context
# upload otherwise. The Dockerfile only ever COPYs server/ and client/
# explicitly, so this is a build-speed fix, not a correctness one.
capacitor/
src-tauri/

client/node_modules/
client/dist/
server/node_modules/
server/dist/

.git/
*.md
